And to answer the question that came up later in the thread:  if you are
a chaotic character, you can convert altars to lawful and get holy water
from them if you can lay your hands on a helm of opposite alignment.  It
works for neutrals too -- it randomly changes their alignment to lawful
or chaotic each time you put it on.

